@base = http://localhost:8080

### Consultar (espera 200; no início, campos vazios)
GET {{base}}/user

### Substituir o usuário (espera 200)
PUT {{base}}/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Lain Iwakura",
    "email": "lain@wired.net"
}

### JSON malformado (espera 400)
PUT {{base}}/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Lain Iwakura",

### Campo obrigatório faltando (espera 400)
PUT {{base}}/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Lain Iwakura"
}